<title>JAPAN: Nomura case undermines trust in Japan bourses -- MOF.</title>
<headline>Nomura case undermines trust in Japan bourses -- MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The scandal over Nomura Securities, whose head office was raided by prosecutors on Thursday for a second time, has gravely undermined people's trust in Japan's stock markets, Vice Finance Minister Tadashi Ogawa told a news conference.</p>
</text>
